  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4304.02 Compliance Determinations",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4304.02 Compliance Determinations.\n\n(a) Subject to (b), below, compliance with the operating practices specified in Table 4304-1 shall be determined on a 3-hour rolling average basis.\n\n(b) Charge rate for batch incinerators shall be determined on a calendar-day 24-hour basis.\n\nSource. #8787, eff 1-5-07; ss by #10765, eff 1-22-15; ss by #14248, eff 5-20-25, EXPIRES: 5-20-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4300.html"
